/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*--------------------------------*\
  species/Lac.dat -- ONE model species, ONE typed file: the lactate anion.

  NO `aqueousThermo` ON PURPOSE.  The ionisation (pK, dH) of lactic acid is measured in
  Nims & Smith, J. Biol. Chem. 113 (1936) 145, Table II, p. 148, and is in chemistry/ -- so the
  SPECIATION (pH, distribution) is complete.  No work in hand prints a formation enthalpy or
  entropy of this aqueous ion, so a balance that needs its enthalpy REFUSES BY NAME instead of
  borrowing a value.
\*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
recordType modelSpecies;
schemaVersion 1;

name    Lac;
formula     "C3H5O3-";
charge  -1;
MW { value 89.070; unit g/mol;}
